WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:07.890
This is Paver. A shared workspace for construction projects,
with a dashboard showing the jobs that need attention.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:15.290
Open Projects to see each site, its progress, and its delivery
date. The details stay with the job.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:22.410
Purchasing and inventory help you follow materials. Check what’s
in the warehouse, and what’s gone to site.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:30.170
Staff payments and financial records stay connected too. Your
team can see each entry and follow it up.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:37.570
Compare costs with the project budget. Keep the records close,
and the whole team working from the same picture.
